 "description": "<p>A one-piece in waterproof material, cut as a cartoon-style swimsuit with an open-crotch construction. The fabric is the swimwear grade you would expect from an actual suit, which puts this a step up from costume-grade polyester.</p>\n<p>The open cut is the functional core of the design; the print and silhouette handle the costume side. Because the material is genuinely waterproof, it holds up in situations costume versions cannot.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: waterproof swim fabric</li>\n<li>Item type: one-piece swimsuit</li>\n<li>Style: cartoon print, open crotch</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Wear it as costume lingerie or as the swimsuit it is technically built to be.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Waterproof open-crotch one-piece swimsuit in cartoon print, one size for 40-60 kg, as pictured.</p>\n",
